# NASA 3D Matching & Planetary Geology Atlas

This repository serves as the central data hub and analysis pipeline for matching 3D models with global geological datasets (Earth, Moon, Mars).

## 📂 Project Structure & Files

* **`Criteria`** – Defined criteria and parameters for 3D matching.
* **`finalfile.xlsx`** – Evaluation spreadsheet containing matched properties and results.
* **`global_planetary_downloader-v2.py`** – Python script to automatically download global Level-3 topography and geology datasets (ETOPO1 for Earth, LOLA for Moon, MOLA for Mars).
* **`global_planetary_geology/`** – Local directory for downloaded `.tif` and `.img` maps used for QGIS visualization.

